OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785586720
OL,3,CFresh appeal and #20k reward offered
OL,4,Cfor Lyra McKee murder
OL,6,FPolice have renewed their appeal over
OL,7,Fthe murder of the journalist Lyra
OL,8,FMcKee and, in conjunction with charity
OL,9,FCrimestoppers, have offered a #20,000
OL,10,Freward for information.
OL,12,FThe 29-year-old died after being hit
OL,13,Fby a bullet as she stood close to
OL,14,Fpolice vehicles while observing a riot
OL,15,Fin the Creggan area of Londonderry on
OL,16,FApril 18 2019.
OL,18,FEarlier this year, three men were
OL,19,Ffound not guilty of her murder
OL,20,Ffollowing a trial.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/9
