PN,41502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785586720
OL,3,CFresh appeal and #20k reward offered
OL,4,Cfor Lyra McKee murder
OL,6,FPaul McIntyre, 58, of Kells Walk in
OL,7,FDerry, Peter Cavanagh, 38, of Mary
OL,8,FStreet, and Jordan Gareth Devine, 25,
OL,9,Fof Bishop Street, faced a joint
OL,10,Fenterprise murder charge.
OL,12,FNo-one has ever been charged with
OL,13,Ffiring the gun in the killing.
OL,15,FFollowing the trial, Ms McKee's sister
OL,16,FNichola Corner called for an end to
OL,17,Fthe "culture of silence" in Northern
OL,18,FIreland which meant people did not
OL,19,Fcome forward with information about
OL,20,Fthe killing.
OL,26,@yD@EOUyD@XO]
