OL,3,CFresh appeal and #20k reward offered
OL,4,Cfor Lyra McKee murder
OL,6,FOn Friday, the Police Service of
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland issued a renewed
OL,8,Fappeal for information.
OL,10,FThe appeal is supported by the
OL,11,Findependent charity Crimestoppers,
OL,12,Fwhich is offering a reward of up to
OL,13,F#20,000 for information given directly
OL,14,Fto the charity that leads to the
OL,15,Farrest and conviction of those
OL,16,Fresponsible.
OL,18,FDetective Chief Inspector Hazel Miller
OL,19,Fsaid Ms McKee's family deserve answers.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
