OL,3,CFresh appeal and #20k reward offered
OL,4,Cfor Lyra McKee murder
OL,6,F"My thoughts remain, above all else,
OL,7,Fwith Lyra's loving family and
OL,8,Ffriends," she said.
OL,10,F"Her murder robbed them of a much-
OL,11,Floved daughter, sister, partner,
OL,12,Ffriend and colleague, and they have
OL,13,Fhad to live with the pain of that loss
OL,14,Fevery day since.
OL,16,F"No family should have to endure this
OL,17,Fongoing torment. They deserve answers.
OL,18,FThey deserve to see those responsible
OL,19,Fheld accountable.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@IO]rD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
