PN,41505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785586720
OL,3,CFresh appeal and #20k reward offered
OL,4,Cfor Lyra McKee murder
OL,6,F"For more than seven years, detectives
OL,7,Fhave worked tirelessly and with
OL,8,Fdetermination, to bring those
OL,9,Fresponsible for this senseless and
OL,10,Fdevastating murder to justice.
OL,12,F"That commitment has not weakened with
OL,13,Ftime; it remains as strong today as it
OL,14,Fwas on the day Lyra was killed."
OL,16,FShe welcomed the Crimestoppers renewed
OL,17,Freward, and added: "In particular, we
OL,18,Fare seeking information on the gunman
OL,19,Fwho carried out this senseless killing.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@`O]yD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
