PN,41506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785586720
OL,3,CFresh appeal and #20k reward offered
OL,4,Cfor Lyra McKee murder
OL,6,F"I know there are people who have
OL,7,Finformation but may feel unable,
OL,8,Freluctant or frightened to come
OL,9,Fforward.
OL,11,F"I am appealing directly to you,
OL,12,Fplease take this opportunity to do the
OL,13,Fright thing. Your information, however
OL,14,Fsmall or unimportant it may seem,
OL,15,Fcould be the missing piece that helps
OL,16,Fus deliver justice for Lyra and her
OL,17,Ffamily.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785586720
OL,3,CFresh appeal and #20k reward offered
OL,4,Cfor Lyra McKee murder
OL,6,F"People's circumstances change.
OL,7,FAllegiances change. The reasons that
OL,8,Fmay once have stopped someone speaking
OL,9,Fto police may no longer apply. We
OL,10,Fremain ready to listen, and we will
OL,11,Ftreat every piece of information with
OL,12,Fthe seriousness it deserves."
OL,14,FShe said: "Lyra's murder caused deep
OL,15,Fhurt and lasting trauma ` not only for
OL,16,Fthose who loved her, but across the
OL,17,Fwider community. The condemnation of
OL,18,Fher killing was unequivocal, and the
OL,19,Fimpact of that terrible night is still
OL,20,Ffelt today.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@]O]vD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
